<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  The dark wait. This is the `brand-open-wait` phase from src/app/globals.css:
  flat #05040a and nothing else. The identity is assembled by CircadiaOpenWindow
  once the scene is active, in layers, the same way the Dock builds it. A launch
  screen that already showed the finished wordmark left the phone with nothing to
  play — it was the whole reason the Dock open read better than this one.
-->
